  <h1>Chromatron (macOS)</h1>

  <p>Original game by <a href="https://www.silverspaceship.com/chromatron/">Silver Spaceship Software</a>.<br>
  Recompiled binaries posted with the original author's permission.<br>
  Recompilation by <a href="https://p.migdal.pl/">Piotr Migda&#x142;</a> (blog post coming soon).</p>

  <h2>Download</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/__DIST_REPO__/releases/latest/download/Chromatron-macos-apple-silicon-unsigned.dmg">Download macOS Apple Silicon (.dmg)</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/__DIST_REPO__/releases/latest/download/Chromatron-macos-intel-unsigned.dmg">Download macOS Intel (.dmg)</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Installation on macOS</h2>
  <p>If you download the app and get a message saying the app is damaged and cannot be opened, run the following command in Terminal:</p>
  <pre><code>xattr -cr /Applications/Chromatron.app</code></pre>
  <p>(Or point to wherever you placed the app). This is necessary because the app is not signed with an Apple Developer ID.</p>

